        <item>
            <title>0.2.16</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 15:51:09 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/serafimcloud/firstlight-releases/releases/tag/0.2.16</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/serafimcloud/firstlight-releases/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>25</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.16</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[New menu-bar controls let you choose whether friends appear there and set a maximum from one to five.
Improves refresh feedback and keeps the day tray open while data updates.
The onboarding transition no longer exposes the desktop between windows, and buttons now respond consistently on hover.
Improves local recording preparation and removes unused Settings and status code.
]]></description>
